{
"file": 10,
"paths": [
"d002/f599"
],
"lines": [
{
"n": 0,
"h": "0c097b6e",
"en_raw": "...Black Dog?"
},
{
"n": 1,
"h": "ef2253db",
"en_raw": "Yes, a big dog"
},
{
"n": 2,
"h": "746be061",
"en_raw": "with rabies, apparently"
},
{
"n": 3,
"h": "553af1c4",
"en_raw": "Kurumi wants to see it!"
},
{
"n": 4,
"h": "793fae12",
"en_raw": "Whoa, that's dangerous, you know"
},
{
"n": 5,
"h": "f7a83c82",
"en_raw": "We should get home quick"
},
{
"n": 6,
"h": "a11fdc3a",
"en_raw": "Oh, Sango's scared too"
},
{
"n": 7,
"h": "80efc59d",
"en_raw": "Listen, a big black stray dog"
},
{
"n": 8,
"h": "065c481e",
"en_raw": "pounces on you"
},
{
"n": 9,
"h": "554b3a4e",
"en_raw": "and tears you apart while you're alive"
},
{
"n": 10,
"h": "beb32d9e",
"en_raw": "Do you know anyone who's not scared?"
},
{
"n": 11,
"h": "c2743569",
"en_raw": "...You're exaggerating"
},
{
"n": 12,
"h": "1a68e8b5",
"en_raw": "Listen, not every dog in the world"
},
{
"n": 13,
"h": "cce34d1f",
"en_raw": "is a little dim and weak"
},
{
"n": 14,
"h": "156c50d7",
"en_raw": "like Melos"
},
{
"n": 15,
"h": "bb023435",
"en_raw": "Big dogs are basically"
},
{
"n": 16,
"h": "345f2011",
"en_raw": "ferocious and dangerous"
},
{
"n": 17,
"h": "53551d70",
"en_raw": "If one like that"
},
{
"n": 18,
"h": "8400c7be",
"en_raw": "were carrying a human arm in its mouth"
},
{
"n": 19,
"h": "ef91f01a",
"en_raw": "roaming the streets of Hirumi..."
},
{
"n": 20,
"h": "2544e341",
"en_raw": "...Fine, I'll go home together"
},
{
"n": 21,
"h": "0a3e3372",
"en_raw": "Sorry, Nao, go home alone"
},
{
"n": 22,
"h": "7c6f2320",
"en_raw": "Somehow, I"
},
{
"n": 23,
"h": "62af40cf",
"en_raw": "want to see it once"
},
{
"n": 24,
"h": "313ba078",
"en_raw": "...What!?"
},
{
"n": 25,
"h": "ea4f08a7",
"en_raw": "Oh, leave Melos with me"
},
{
"n": 26,
"h": "6d0dc7cf",
"en_raw": "He'll be my bodyguard"
},
{
"n": 27,
"h": "77182878",
"en_raw": "No way, then I'm coming too"
},
{
"n": 28,
"h": "e33f4630",
"en_raw": "Yay, everybody"
},
{
"n": 29,
"h": "5d8235a1",
"en_raw": "let's go see the doggy!"
},
{
"n": 30,
"h": "4620cc8a",
"en_raw": "Okay Melos, if anything happens"
},
{
"n": 31,
"h": "ad58ea4c",
"en_raw": "you protect me"
},
{
"n": 32,
"h": "51d74895",
"en_raw": "with your life"
},
{
"n": 33,
"h": "31b9c49d",
"en_raw": "Karugane Elementary"
},
{
"n": 34,
"h": "8bed2fc7",
"en_raw": "was around where, again?"
},
{
"n": 35,
"h": "d2f6e76f",
"en_raw": "Karugane Elementary..."
},
{
"n": 36,
"h": "477812ad",
"en_raw": "Brings back memories"
},
{
"n": 37,
"h": "5f1284c1",
"en_raw": "The shrine is close, right?"
},
{
"n": 38,
"h": "d2e15c90",
"en_raw": "Didn't you stop by?"
},
{
"n": 39,
"h": "e4b3e340",
"en_raw": "I didn't, much..."
},
{
"n": 40,
"h": "9b257b40",
"en_raw": "If you come from Mukaibashi Avenue"
},
{
"n": 41,
"h": "c355e499",
"en_raw": "it's pretty close"
},
{
"n": 42,
"h": "fc8c992f",
"en_raw": "So that area is"
},
{
"n": 43,
"h": "dac8f71a",
"en_raw": "the black dog's territory"
},
{
"n": 44,
"h": "76829c8d",
"en_raw": "From the look of it, we"
},
{
"n": 45,
"h": "83977c14",
"en_raw": "probably won't meet a dangerous dog"
},
{
"n": 46,
"h": "6bf19771",
"en_raw": "I don't know if that's good"
},
{
"n": 47,
"h": "fff3ebcc",
"en_raw": "or a shame"
},
{
"n": 48,
"h": "7684330b",
"en_raw": "It was just a rumor"
},
{
"n": 49,
"h": "6ecb8e46",
"en_raw": "Hey hey, Nao"
},
{
"n": 50,
"h": "6e6d9286",
"en_raw": "Kurumi wants to keep that Kuro"
},
{
"n": 51,
"h": "25f31a97",
"en_raw": "...Kuro? Black Dog?"
},
{
"n": 52,
"h": "2dddf136",
"en_raw": "Shiina, did you see it?"
},
{
"n": 53,
"h": "85bffbff",
"en_raw": "It was near the elementary school"
},
{
"n": 54,
"h": "3dc76dbb",
"en_raw": "It ran off when"
},
{
"n": 55,
"h": "2751bc77",
"en_raw": "a car guy came"
},
{
"n": 56,
"h": "907a6956",
"en_raw": "Hey hey"
},
{
"n": 57,
"h": "b4fe6fcf",
"en_raw": "next time, Kurumi too..."
},
{
"n": 58,
"h": "2d4ed055",
"en_raw": "Melos's leash"
},
{
"n": 59,
"h": "c834b00f",
"en_raw": "I want to hold it~"
},
{
"n": 60,
"h": "941d1080",
"en_raw": "Shiina, really, really"
},
{
"n": 61,
"h": "3ce08256",
"en_raw": "was there a Black Dog?"
},
{
"n": 62,
"h": "d7e1e0b2",
"en_raw": "...Yeah"
},
{
"n": 63,
"h": "0d2460ce",
"en_raw": "Look me in the eye and say it"
},
{
"n": 64,
"h": "b3a51daf",
"en_raw": "Is it true?"
},
{
"n": 65,
"h": "abf24aa7",
"en_raw": "Yeah, it is"
},
{
"n": 66,
"h": "6ae6e4f9",
"en_raw": "...I think?"
},
{
"n": 67,
"h": "cf3cd520",
"en_raw": "...Shiina"
},
{
"n": 68,
"h": "05dad037",
"en_raw": "Oh no, Sango"
},
{
"n": 69,
"h": "0b6971d6",
"en_raw": "is angry..."
},
{
"n": 70,
"h": "32f7c108",
"en_raw": "Stop it, Sango"
},
{
"n": 71,
"h": "366de67f",
"en_raw": "Then, hey"
},
{
"n": 72,
"h": "a8db9412",
"en_raw": "let's look for it again"
},
{
"n": 73,
"h": "7fe2e000",
"en_raw": "If we know where it went"
},
{
"n": 74,
"h": "c68c4741",
"en_raw": "you'll be satisfied, right, Sango?"
},
{
"n": 75,
"h": "08dd3080",
"en_raw": "Well, yeah..."
},
{
"n": 76,
"h": "907a6956",
"en_raw": "Hey hey"
},
{
"n": 77,
"h": "b4fe6fcf",
"en_raw": "next time, Kurumi too..."
},
{
"n": 78,
"h": "2d4ed055",
"en_raw": "Melos's leash"
},
{
"n": 79,
"h": "c834b00f",
"en_raw": "I want to hold it~"
},
{
"n": 80,
"h": "2335c4ba",
"en_raw": "Hey, Nao, that atmosphere"
},
{
"n": 81,
"h": "22625e11",
"en_raw": "felt a bit like an emergency, right?"
},
{
"n": 82,
"h": "21e3c4aa",
"en_raw": "We'd better stay away from there"
},
{
"n": 83,
"h": "7843d6cc",
"en_raw": "for a while"
},
{
"n": 84,
"h": "81889600",
"en_raw": "Sadly, looks that way"
},
{
"n": 85,
"h": "4b5c5d91",
"en_raw": "But that Kuro"
},
{
"n": 86,
"h": "98c7d96b",
"en_raw": "doesn't do anything"
},
{
"n": 87,
"h": "8926237c",
"en_raw": "...Shiina"
},
{
"n": 88,
"h": "80577e9b",
"en_raw": "Did you really see it?"
},
{
"n": 89,
"h": "abf24aa7",
"en_raw": "Yeah, it is"
},
{
"n": 90,
"h": "af4d99f5",
"en_raw": "Kurumi wants that Kuro"
},
{
"n": 91,
"h": "3dbe6940",
"en_raw": "...Where did you see it?"
},
{
"n": 92,
"h": "32f7e057",
"en_raw": "But it went home, you know"
},
{
"n": 93,
"h": "1213d3df",
"en_raw": "Mr. Black Dog's home"
},
{
"n": 94,
"h": "0f2e81e1",
"en_raw": "...Where is that?"
},
{
"n": 95,
"h": "dd30e0f1",
"en_raw": "What do you mean where? I'm"
},
{
"n": 96,
"h": "71281caa",
"en_raw": "the one asking, aren't I?"
},
{
"n": 97,
"h": "c066abc0",
"en_raw": "Um, that kind of building..."
},
{
"n": 98,
"h": "79732af1",
"en_raw": "I forgot..."
},
{
"n": 99,
"h": "d3ef6763",
"en_raw": "Tch"
},
{
"n": 100,
"h": "fe8296e2",
"en_raw": "I wasted my time asking seriously"
},
{
"n": 101,
"h": "83331730",
"en_raw": "But let's check out"
},
{
"n": 102,
"h": "56cb7c97",
"en_raw": "that area once more"
},
{
"n": 103,
"h": "75055b71",
"en_raw": "...People other than Shiina, that is"
},
{
"n": 104,
"h": "be189492",
"en_raw": "Even so, does it really exist?"
},
{
"n": 105,
"h": "db61c07c",
"en_raw": "That Black Dog"
},
{
"n": 106,
"h": "fe012906",
"en_raw": "Well, anyway"
},
{
"n": 107,
"h": "4e476787",
"en_raw": "we just have to go see"
},
{
"n": 108,
"h": "5017d4c5",
"en_raw": "...But if you see it"
},
{
"n": 109,
"h": "385d56d0",
"en_raw": "run away right away"
},
{
"n": 110,
"h": "dc0e8fb2",
"en_raw": "without looking back"
},
{
"n": 111,
"h": "949a0e32",
"en_raw": "So in the end, our only lead"
},
{
"n": 112,
"h": "63f0ba83",
"en_raw": "is Shiina's eyewitness account..."
},
{
"n": 113,
"h": "42225e53",
"en_raw": "Enough, Sango"
},
{
"n": 114,
"h": "ff1e9aa6",
"en_raw": "I'm really glad nothing happened"
},
{
"n": 115,
"h": "9933966d",
"en_raw": "Mr. Black Dog went"
},
{
"n": 116,
"h": "a64747c0",
"en_raw": "back home"
},
{
"n": 117,
"h": "32c8de52",
"en_raw": "So where is that?"
},
{
"n": 118,
"h": "cfbd0307",
"en_raw": "Right, um"
},
{
"n": 119,
"h": "9219f827",
"en_raw": "That kind of building..."
},
{
"n": 120,
"h": "437e5e38",
"en_raw": "...Where?"
},
{
"n": 121,
"h": "34990557",
"en_raw": "I'm the one"
},
{
"n": 122,
"h": "c0f6029f",
"en_raw": "asking!"
},
{
"n": 123,
"h": "94cb8f6e",
"en_raw": "Oh, I remembered properly"
},
{
"n": 124,
"h": "7c04c208",
"en_raw": "Right, his home is"
},
{
"n": 125,
"h": "0efa5787",
"en_raw": "the city hall"
},
{
"n": 126,
"h": "8cdbf74d",
"en_raw": "...I think?"
},
{
"n": 127,
"h": "7356f437",
"en_raw": "That's not proper at all"
},
{
"n": 128,
"h": "75b14fe4",
"en_raw": "Kurumi wants to keep it~"
},
{
"n": 129,
"h": "c1796e98",
"en_raw": "Then I'll go"
},
{
"n": 130,
"h": "69f44ee2",
"en_raw": "The place the dog vanished"
},
{
"n": 131,
"h": "685bf512",
"en_raw": "Are you two planning to go"
},
{
"n": 132,
"h": "5546bd05",
"en_raw": "to a pet shop or something?"
},
{
"n": 133,
"h": "8761979b",
"en_raw": "...Melos will be jealous"
},
{
"n": 134,
"h": "1dbeebe8",
"en_raw": "You're the jealous one, Sango"
},
{
"n": 135,
"h": "8ab80cc6",
"en_raw": "You're going to city hall to buy a dog, right?"
},
{
"n": 136,
"h": "73c7933d",
"en_raw": "Hurry up and go"
},
{
"n": 137,
"h": "91a71bdd",
"en_raw": "City hall, Mr. Black Dog"
},
{
"n": 138,
"h": "e78dc17f",
"en_raw": "wasn't there today"
},
{
"n": 139,
"h": "73d9e4b8",
"en_raw": "...Acting like you know nothing"
},
{
"n": 140,
"h": "7c96e7eb",
"en_raw": "you're pretty sarcastic"
},
{
"n": 141,
"h": "fcd23681",
"en_raw": "Shiina"
},
{
"n": 142,
"h": "d3438cae",
"en_raw": "Oh, is Sango angry?"
},
{
"n": 143,
"h": "ddeb7c7e",
"en_raw": "How is that city hall?!"
},
{
"n": 144,
"h": "9a6b0560",
"en_raw": "This is sickening..."
},
{
"n": 145,
"h": "91077566",
"en_raw": "First time I've ever felt so awful"
},
{
"n": 146,
"h": "f58df671",
"en_raw": "I'm sorry"
},
{
"n": 147,
"h": "33848357",
"en_raw": "As long as you get it"
},
{
"n": 148,
"h": "c8d6b6b7",
"en_raw": "So in the end, the Black Dog..."
},
{
"n": 149,
"h": "e0011335",
"en_raw": "was caught long ago"
},
{
"n": 150,
"h": "309eaf27",
"en_raw": "and is in a cage at that city hall"
},
{
"n": 151,
"h": "c15ac331",
"en_raw": "with sad eyes"
},
{
"n": 152,
"h": "522da05f",
"en_raw": "waiting for its owner!"
},
{
"n": 153,
"h": "b7f9f02e",
"en_raw": ".........."
},
{
"n": 154,
"h": "7f956e5b",
"en_raw": "What"
},
{
"n": 155,
"h": "c78222c0",
"en_raw": "Whatever you think"
},
{
"n": 156,
"h": "e0732ee1",
"en_raw": "this is reality"
},
{
"n": 157,
"h": "ec7f4467",
"en_raw": "...Still, I'm going back"
},
{
"n": 158,
"h": "79f7130c",
"en_raw": "to that place once more"
},
{
"n": 159,
"h": "b9832cf5",
"en_raw": "...Do what you want"
},
{
"n": 160,
"h": "cb8944f1",
"en_raw": "Nao's kind of"
},
{
"n": 161,
"h": "34b4e370",
"en_raw": "annoying today"
},
{
"n": 162,
"h": "a3d96927",
"en_raw": "Was the health center"
},
{
"n": 163,
"h": "d32ca348",
"en_raw": "that much of a shock?"
},
{
"n": 164,
"h": "3764dd8c",
"en_raw": "......"
},
{
"n": 165,
"h": "2689395d",
"en_raw": "You don't have to feel"
},
{
"n": 166,
"h": "538ab412",
"en_raw": "guilty at all"
},
{
"n": 167,
"h": "490f216e",
"en_raw": "But..."
},
{
"n": 168,
"h": "b3c40279",
"en_raw": "Feeling strange pity"
},
{
"n": 169,
"h": "46718f25",
"en_raw": "won't change anything"
},
{
"n": 170,
"h": "ef4355aa",
"en_raw": "I know, but"
},
{
"n": 171,
"h": "c658db21",
"en_raw": "...Let's go home?"
},
{
"n": 172,
"h": "8dcbd947",
"en_raw": "I'm tired today too"
},
{
"n": 173,
"h": "de0e8b37",
"en_raw": "I haven't heard of the Black Dog showing up"
},
{
"n": 174,
"h": "d1c152bf",
"en_raw": "Maybe there was never"
},
{
"n": 175,
"h": "1e945f76",
"en_raw": "a dog like that..."
},
{
"n": 176,
"h": "25c23a31",
"en_raw": "There might have been, but"
},
{
"n": 177,
"h": "ba43f98e",
"en_raw": "it was caught"
},
{
"n": 178,
"h": "0720168b",
"en_raw": "And then, the health center...?"
},
{
"n": 179,
"h": "bea81965",
"en_raw": "Poor thing"
},
{
"n": 180,
"h": "579349de",
"en_raw": "There are people who abandon dogs"
},
{
"n": 181,
"h": "b6c0161c",
"en_raw": "so it has to be done"
},
{
"n": 182,
"h": "026661dc",
"en_raw": "Because if a town had stray dogs"
},
{
"n": 183,
"h": "16d5164c",
"en_raw": "roaming like in this rumor"
},
{
"n": 184,
"h": "5add1722",
"en_raw": "we couldn't live here"
},
{
"n": 185,
"h": "4f30f8cd",
"en_raw": "That's true, but..."
},
{
"n": 186,
"h": "1ea59357",
"en_raw": "It's selfish, though"
},
{
"n": 187,
"h": "8f0ef26e",
"en_raw": "Yeah..."
},
{
"n": 188,
"h": "15921261",
"en_raw": "Come to think of it, Melos"
},
{
"n": 189,
"h": "c80b1983",
"en_raw": "was an abandoned dog too"
},
{
"n": 190,
"h": "6b42eae1",
"en_raw": "Sango picked him up"
},
{
"n": 191,
"h": "1c1b85ca",
"en_raw": "Right, he was little back then"
},
{
"n": 192,
"h": "9353a051",
"en_raw": "and so cute"
},
{
"n": 193,
"h": "d4867e86",
"en_raw": "I couldn't leave him alone"
},
{
"n": 194,
"h": "d5978890",
"en_raw": "But if Sango hadn't"
},
{
"n": 195,
"h": "b516bd71",
"en_raw": "found him then..."
},
{
"n": 196,
"h": "29ffd43e",
"en_raw": "What if my house"
},
{
"n": 197,
"h": "0ea4e5c3",
"en_raw": "had said we couldn't keep him?"
},
{
"n": 198,
"h": "34cf0292",
"en_raw": "........"
},
{
"n": 199,
"h": "2ec8192b",
"en_raw": "Sorry, let's stop this talk"
},
{
"n": 200,
"h": "ca603612",
"en_raw": "No, but now"
},
{
"n": 201,
"h": "3683588c",
"en_raw": "Melos is my Melos"
},
{
"n": 202,
"h": "51990456",
"en_raw": "We'll be together forever"
},
{
"n": 203,
"h": "fb58c000",
"en_raw": "Lucky Nao"
},
{
"n": 204,
"h": "0f6d8c84",
"en_raw": "Lucky Melos"
},
{
"n": 205,
"h": "df754a84",
"en_raw": "Kurumi wants a pet too"
},
{
"n": 206,
"h": "debce1eb",
"en_raw": "Solved the rumor of the Black Dog"
},
{
"n": 207,
"h": "fb58c000",
"en_raw": "Lucky Nao"
},
{
"n": 208,
"h": "0f6d8c84",
"en_raw": "Lucky Melos"
},
